INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(3876,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5075982','Integrating precision cancer medicine into healthcare-policy, practice, and research challenges.','Bertier G, Carrot-Zhang J, Ragoussis V, Joly Y.','2016','publicized mlh nonpolyposis boadicea brcapro ibis spinoff grail gefitinib vemurafenib dasatinib palb2 eloquently soup ignite sectorial misalignment methylome subclones subclonal cser dbsnp exac cbioportal icgc icgc icgcmed scrp ga4gh ambry exomes ambryshare targetable pharmgkb systematized cheapest admittedly nanotechnologies pathophysiologically admittedly flooded tsunami p3g ga4gh misaligned blay consensual overshadowed portrayal overtake deem manolio globalized tackled sectorial operability ignite subclonal interoperable ga4gh p3g ga4gh ignite p3g grim portrayal nora pashayan therese papillon cavanagh exactis nserc sshrc frq chercheur boursier croc finalization jcz boadicea cser exac ga4gh ibis icgc ignite p3g scrp mullard ontariogenomics fayerman verge postmedia mulholland domchek friebel høberg vetti bjorvatn fiane woie espelid mavaddat pharoah pdp michailidou tyrer bolla djv036 pharoah pdp antoniou tischkowitz tavtigian nathanson nejmsr1501341 barrdahl auer gaudet nonmodifiable closas gunsoy dju305 foulkes nrclinonc strotman millner s40291 criscitiello locatelli curigliano pharmthera sahm schrimpf dtw kratz reuss iwanik reifenberger deimling figarella branger cavenee schwaederle eggermont schilsky mendelsohn jcd nri3820 nrclinonc melero gaudernack gerritsen parmiani nrclinonc vanneman dranoff nrc3237 wargo flaherty universes collide lieskovan homet ribas aaa8172 pharmgkb cancerpgx cancers6042296 tourneau delord gavoille dubot isambert shiva laskin aparicio deyell a000570 a000570 bayrak toydemir deignan senecal rahimzadeh avard sinnett gargis kalman dimmock funke matthijs souche alders corveleyn eck feenstra bubela charbonneau critchley soup lsw018 ignite ignite cabana abboud wensing gagliardi alhabib meyerson getz nrg2841 wag